{"id":"velocidad","lemma":"velocidad","pos":"noun","rank":1044,"glosses":["speed","velocity","gear"],"ipa":"/beloθiˈdad/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"velocidades"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/8/85/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-velocidad.wav","examples":[{"text":"No hay un límite de velocidad.","en":"There's no speed limit.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/460292","words":[{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"to have","l":"haber"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"limit"},{"g":"of / from"},null]},{"text":"La velocidad no lo es todo.","en":"Speed isn't everything.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/460912","words":[{"g":"the / her"},null,{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"it / him"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"all"}]},{"text":"¿Sabes a qué velocidad ibas?","en":"Do you know how fast you were going?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/610001","words":[{"g":"to know, to understand","l":"saber"},{"g":"to"},{"g":"what"},null,{"g":"to go","l":"ir"}]},{"text":"El tren marchaba a toda velocidad.","en":"The train was running at full speed.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/687922","words":[{"g":"the"},{"g":"train"},{"g":"to go, travel","l":"marchar"},{"g":"to"},{"g":"all","l":"todo"},null]},{"text":"Él calculó la velocidad de la luz.","en":"He calculated the speed of light.","words":[{"g":"he"},{"g":"to calculate","l":"calcular"},{"g":"the / her"},null,null,null,{"g":"light"}],"phrases":[[4,6,"of the"]]}]}